# bundle-ignore.windows — extra exclusions for the "windows" (tools-only) profile.
# Layered ON TOP of scripts/bundle-ignore. Same gitignore syntax.
#
# The Windows bundle ships only the standalone tools (FCC lookup, ICS forms,
# RepeaterBook, net logger, radio references, handbook, calculators) — no Pi
# hardware, no panels or displays, no APRS/Winlink daemons, no offline maps,
# no Wikipedia.

# ── Pi-only hardware, panel and display integrations ──
# features/ covers every hardware add-on, panels included (the CM4Stack panel
# lives at features/cm4stack).
oasis-dashboard/
features/

# ── large / Pi-only data sets ──
zim/
maps/
